 ### Data Structures
-The method relies on the engine's native mesh resource structure [S1]. The source mesh is stored as a collection of indexed triangle surfaces [S2]. Each surface contains vertex positions, normals, and UV coordinates [S2]. The UV coordinates must be assigned within the 3D modeler, as the engine does not generate them procedurally for custom meshes [S1].
